#!/usr/bin/python3
"""
encs-switch-tui - terminal UI for the Marvell BobCat2 L2 switch in a Cisco ENCS 5412.

Speaks the same "wcd" XML API that Cisco's switch-confd used, so it needs
neither ConfD nor the (non-functional) embedded web UI.

RUN THIS ON THE HYPERVISOR. The switch answers on 169.254.1.0 over VLAN 2363
on the X710 backplane, and that NIC belongs to the host. The bootstrap VM only
boots the ASIC over PCIe and cannot reach the switch at all.

Environment:
    SW_IP      default 169.254.1.0
    SW_USER    default cisco
    SW_PASS    default cisco
    SW_CFG_DIR default /etc/encs-switch
    ENCS_REPO  GitHub repo --update pulls from
    ENCS_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1   skip the startup release check entirely

Non-interactive:
    encs-switch-tui --save     capture running config to SW_CFG_DIR
    encs-switch-tui --apply    replay SW_CFG_DIR (used by encs-switch-replay)
    encs-switch-tui --status   one-line health check, exit 0/1
    encs-switch-tui --version  print the version and exit
    encs-switch-tui --check-update   ask GitHub whether a newer release exists
    encs-switch-tui --update   install the latest release (needs root)

Stdlib only.
"""
